293
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:50,580
No drive, no copay.

294
00:07:50,620 --> 00:07:52,410
They say twenty minutes.

295
00:07:52,630 --> 00:07:53,720
I did thirty,

296
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:55,010
twice a day,

297
00:07:55,010 --> 00:07:56,850
lowest setting that first
week.

298
00:07:56,950 --> 00:07:58,410
I put it on the calendar.

299
00:07:58,480 --> 00:07:59,630
The first week,

300
00:07:59,630 --> 00:08:00,460
I couldn't have told

301
00:08:00,460 --> 00:08:01,940
you if anything was
happening.

302
00:08:01,980 --> 00:08:02,910
I tried not to get

303
