327
00:08:37,020 --> 00:08:38,450
I wanted to understand
why,

328
00:08:38,450 --> 00:08:39,820
so I read the whole thing.

329
00:08:40,340 --> 00:08:42,250
It comes down to four
steps.

330
00:08:42,290 --> 00:08:42,970
One.

331
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,480
The tissue around a new

332
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:46,360
