over.

334
00:08:48,910 --> 00:08:49,580
Two.

335
00:08:49,830 --> 00:08:52,130
Inflamed tissue holds
extra fluid,

336
00:08:52,130 --> 00:08:53,100
so it takes up more

337
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:54,240
