338
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,080
Three.

339
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:57,190
There's only so much room
in there.

340
00:08:57,250 --> 00:08:58,700
Bending compresses it.

341
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,700
Straightening pulls it
tight.

342
00:09:00,890 --> 00:09:02,330
That's the squeeze.

343
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:03,380
Four.

344
00:09:03,550 --> 00:09:05,960
Red and near-infrared
light have been

345
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:08,300
studied for calming that
inflammation,

346
00:09:08,300 --> 00:09:09,750
so the swelling and the
pressure

347
00:09:09,750 --> 00:09:10,980
can come down with it.

348
00:09:11,250 --> 00:09:12,990
In a randomized trial,

349
00:09:12,990 --> 00:09:14,800
patients given light
therapy after

350
00:09:14,800 --> 00:09:17,500
a knee replacement had
less pain,

351
00:09:17,500 --> 00:09:20,030
less swelling and better
early movement

352
00:09:20,030 --> 00:09:21,360
than those who weren't.

353
00:09:21,930 --> 00:09:25,010
A 2025 review said the
same,

354
00:09:25,010 --> 00:09:27,030
and was clear the evidence

355
00:09:27,030 --> 00:09:28,230
