356
00:09:28,470 --> 00:09:30,310
I probably sound like a
broken record

357
00:09:30,310 --> 00:09:31,660
to the guys on my crew.

358
00:09:32,130 --> 00:09:33,990
But after two years of
doing everything

359
00:09:33,990 --> 00:09:36,270
I was told and getting
nowhere,

360
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:37,820
you have no idea what it's

361
00:09:37,820 --> 00:09:39,490
