night,

362
00:09:39,490 --> 00:09:41,080
say yes to the walk,

363
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,570
and get my life back.

364
00:09:42,730 --> 00:09:43,970
So take it from me.

365
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,870
Don't spend another year
waiting

366
00:09:45,870 --> 00:09:46,920
